cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "social-dLDS: decomposed linear dynamical systems for mouse social behavior"
abstract: >-
  Code accompanying a study that represents mouse action-generating dynamics as a
  signed, graded mixture of shared linear operators acting on kinematic features,
  and compares that representation against keypoint-MoSeq syllables on
  single-mouse and dyadic datasets.
type: software

# `license` below records the licence of the repository as a whole, which CFF
# expects as a single value. It is not the whole story: julia/ is GPL-3.0-or-later
# because it derives from Sai Koukuntla's DLDS package, and the data artifacts are
# CC-BY-4.0. See LICENSE.

authors:
